{"id":"gestalt","lemma":"Gestalt","pos":"noun","rank":3805,"glosses":["shape, form, figure, outline","shape, build of a person, silhouette, profile","figure, character, person"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈʃtalt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/De-Gestalt.ogg/De-Gestalt.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Gestalt","plural":"Gestalten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich sah eine Gestalt in der Dunkelheit.","en":"I saw a shape in the dark.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760823","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"darkness"}]},{"text":"Ich sah die Gestalt eines Mannes.","en":"I saw the figure of a man.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"a, an","l":"ein"},{"g":"man, male human being","l":"Mann"}]},{"text":"Das Projekt nimmt Gestalt an.","en":"The project's taking shape.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"project"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Unsere Pläne nehmen Gestalt an.","en":"Our plans are taking shape.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"project","l":"Plan"},{"g":"to take"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Helden gibt es in jeder Größe und Gestalt.","en":"Heroes come in all shapes and sizes.","words":[{"g":"hero","l":"Held"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"size, height"},{"g":"and"},null]}]}